# 📚 Online Bookstore & Library Management System
### Data Engineering Capstone Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates how raw business data can be transformed into meaningful business insights using a **Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold)**.

The project is based on an Online Bookstore and Library Management System where information about books, customers, orders, library loans, and reviews is processed through different stages of a data pipeline.

Instead of directly analyzing raw data, the project organizes it into multiple layers so that it becomes clean, reliable, and ready for reporting.

---

# 🎯 Project Goal

The main objective of this project was to simulate how a real Data Engineering team builds a production-ready data pipeline.

The pipeline:

- Stores raw operational data
- Cleans and validates the data
- Removes duplicate and invalid records
- Creates business-ready datasets
- Generates KPIs for business analysis

---

# 🗂️ Dataset Used

The project works with five operational tables:

| Table | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| Books | Stores information about books available for sale and lending |
| Customers | Customer registration details |
| Orders | Book purchase transactions |
| Loans | Library borrowing records |
| Reviews | Customer ratings and reviews |

---

# 🏗️ Architecture

The project follows the **Medallion Architecture**.

```
Operational Database
        │
        ▼
   Bronze Layer
(Raw Data Storage)
        │
        ▼
   Silver Layer
(Data Cleaning & Validation)
        │
        ▼
    Gold Layer
(Business Analytics & KPIs)
```

---

# 🥉 Bronze Layer

The Bronze layer stores the raw data exactly as it arrives from the source.

### Work completed

- Created Bronze tables
- Added audit columns
  - `ingested_at`
  - `batch_id`
- Loaded data incrementally
- Implemented watermark logic
- Prevented duplicate loading

This layer acts as the source of truth.

---

# 🥈 Silver Layer

The Silver layer improves the quality of the data.

### Tasks completed

✔ Removed duplicate records

✔ Standardized text values

✔ Validated business rules

✔ Rejected invalid records

✔ Logged rejected rows

✔ Created derived columns such as

- Order Value
- Days Overdue
- Overdue Category

This layer contains clean and trusted data.

---

# 🥇 Gold Layer

The Gold layer is designed for reporting and business analysis.

Instead of storing raw records, it provides summarized business information.

### KPI Views Created

- Monthly Revenue Growth
- Customer Retention Rate
- Book Sell Through Rate
- Library Return Compliance
- Review Coverage Rate

### Additional Business Views

- Top Performing Books
- Customer Segmentation

These views help management understand business performance quickly.

---

# 📊 Pipeline Health Monitoring

The project also includes a pipeline monitoring system.

It tracks:

- Last successful load
- Number of rows processed
- Number of rejected rows
- Rejection percentage
- Pipeline health status

This helps ensure that the pipeline is running correctly.

---

