During this project, the following Data Engineering concepts were implemented:

- SQL DDL
- Incremental Data Loading
- Watermark Pattern
- Transactions
- Data Validation
- Data Cleaning
- Window Functions
- Common Table Expressions (CTEs)
- CASE Statements
- Aggregations
- JOIN Operations
- Views
- Data Quality Checks
- Pipeline Monitoring

