---

# 💡 Business Value

This project demonstrates how an organization can transform raw transactional data into reliable business information.

By separating data into Bronze, Silver, and Gold layers, the system becomes:

- Easier to maintain
- More reliable
- Better for reporting
- Scalable for future growth

